{"articleNo":"92308","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=92308&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[취업] 취업캠프 일정 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.09.25","hit":"3821","attachments":[{"name":"교육역량강화사업 1차 취업캠프 안내.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=download&articleNo=92308&attachNo=73334"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">하반기 공채 및 취업역량강화</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">를 위한</span></font></strong><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">[</span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\" color=\"#0900ff\">취업캠프</font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">]</span></font></strong></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><strong><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">참가인원 모집</span></font></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>가. 목적</strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"> : 입사서류 작성, 이미지메이킹, 실전모의면접 등을 통한 취업준비생 취업역량강화 </span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>나. 교육일정</strong> : 2013년 9월 27일(금) ~ 28일(토) (1박 2일)</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>다. 참가대상 및 인원(2013년 9월 13일 ~ 선착순 마감)</strong></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 금오공대 재학생 누구나(대학원생 제외, 3~4학년 위주)</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 정원 80명</font><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><font color=\"#ff007f\">(현재 추가신청 가능, 취업지원본부 문의)</font></span></strong></span><font style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><br></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>라. 교육장소</strong> : 경북 문경 STX리조트</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><font color=\"#000000\"></font><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>마. 집합장소</strong> <strong>: <font color=\"#0900ff\">9월 27일 오전 10시 10분까지 교문 앞 버스승강장</font></strong></font></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>마. 교육내용</strong></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 팀 활동을 통한 자신감 회복, 취업 마인드 변화</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 2013년 취업동향 및 입사전략 </font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 입사서류 및 자기소개서 작성법 &amp; Clinic </font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 면접 프로세스의 이해/면접유형별 면접전략</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5) 면접 성공을 위한 이미지 메이킹/면접관의 마음을 사로잡는 대화법</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6) 실전모의면접(토론면접/PT면접/영어면접/심층면접)</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><strong>바. 참가신청</strong> : 금오공대 올에듀시스템 (</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><a href=\"http://alledu.kumoh.ac.kr/\"><u style=\"text-underline: #800080 single\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; COLOR: #800080; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\" lang=\"EN-US\">http://alledu.kumoh.ac.kr</span></u></a></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">) 로그인</span></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">-&gt;프로그램신청</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;-&gt;온라인신청-&gt;프로그램목록에서 [<strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">취업역량강화 </font><font color=\"#0900ff\">취업캠프</font></strong>] 선택 후 신청</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\"></font><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>사. 교육강사</strong> : 취업교육 전문강사</font></span><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;</font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>아. 문의처</strong> : 취업지원본부 054-478-7985</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong>자. 기타사항</strong></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1) 다과 및 <strong><font color=\"#0900ff\">숙식 제공</font></strong>, 교육비 무료</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -40.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2) 자율복장(권장사항 : 정장 1벌 준비), 이력서 및 자기소개서 준비, 필기도구, 세면도구,</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -40.6pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 40.6pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 여벌 복장 등 개인 필요물품 지참</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3) 교육 참가자는 향후 진행될</font><font color=\"#0900ff\"><strong> <font color=\"#ff007f\">대기업 직무적성검사 우선배정</font></strong></font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4) 교육역량강화사업 마일리지 3점 부여</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -94.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 94.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5) 제한사항 : <strong>무단불참자</strong>는 향후 <strong>취업지원본부 주관사업 참가 제한</strong> 및 학교취업 추천 </font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -94.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 94.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 시&nbsp;</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">감점</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">(합당한 소명이 있을 경우 제한적으로 허용)</font></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -94.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 94.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -94.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 94.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5; TEXT-INDENT: -94.4pt; MARGIN-LEFT: 94.4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">취 업 지 원 본 부</span></strong></font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
